{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32701","headline":"贺同年翰林从叔舍人知制诰 · 李频","name":"贺同年翰林从叔舍人知制诰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙禁何人蹑近踪，孔门先选得真龙。\n别居云路抛三省，专掌天书在九重。\n五色毫挥成涣汗，百寮班下独从容。\n芳年贵盛谁爲比，郁郁青青岳顶松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}